<!--
    An ingredient that has gone in: the same box, filled, with the tick cut out of it.

    One path with an even-odd fill rather than a tick drawn over a box, because the whole
    drawable is tinted a single colour by the row — so a tick painted on top would be the
    colour of the box it sits on. Cut out, it is the shade showing through, which is legible
    whichever way round that shade is.
-->
